Danish designer.

Conceived the [[Panton Chair]] in 1959, one continuous piece of molded plastic. It took until 1967, working with Vitra, to get it into production. The shape exists because the material and the molding process made it possible.

[[Modernism]], [[Truth to Materials]], [[Technical Nutrient]]
